  <description>
    Simplified Gazebo model derived from model.STEP. It approximates a rack-and-pinion
    linear motion module with aluminium profiles, rails, rack, carriage, rollers and
    a servo/gear drive for reinforcement-learning simulation.
  </description>
</model>
